      "writtenOn": "2026-01-06T17:23:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The only thing that was concerning was this:\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/webm/libvpx/+/6876498/8/vpx/vpx_encoder.h#206\n\nWe talked about this last week offline.\n\nHowever the libtool document broadly says:\n\n\u003e If any interfaces have been added, removed, or changed since the last update,\n\u003e increment current, and set revision to 0",
      "parentUuid": "f8f84cfe_3d73938c",
      "revId": "44551b561a1dcef1c0ef6d6a46a01a81bbe2b2af",
